ˆKathe Kuriake o khrusaetos katebaine apo ton Olumpo, pernouse pano apo ten pole tes Katerines kai sten sunekheia ekane boltes sten odo Paralias. Etan megalos san ena mikro aeroplano. Oi megaloi elegan oti epsakhne te gunaika tou kai to gio tou, eno ta mikra paidia thaumazan ta akrobatika kai ta aeroplanika kolpa pou ekane.
E mikre Elene pisteue oti o aetos erkhotan mono gia keine kai oti kapoia mera tha ten epairne sta phtera tou. Mia Kuriake duo antres me ena autokineto apagagoun te mikte Elene. O aetos parakolouthei to autokineto kai ste Lukoporia kataphernei kai pairnei te mikre Elene sta phtera tou kai khanontai ston Olumpo. O kosmos leei oti o aetos troei paidia kai arkhizoun na ton kunegoun. Astunomia kai elikoptera tou stratou psakhnoun na skotosoun ton aeto. E mikre Elene omos ton agapaei kai einai etoime na thusiastei gia na ton glitosei apo ta kheria tes Astunomias kai tou stratou."˜	
•	E Eutukhia, to trito muthistorema tou diasemou mousikosunthete kai suggraphea tou Megalou Eunoukhou tes Konstantinoupoles, tha mporouse na epigraphetai To muthistorema tes sugkhrones Tourkias.
Treis anthropoi, mesa apo ta ekatommuria ton <>pou de graphoun istoria, anazetoun na lusoun ton kompo tes moiras tous kai na kataktesoun ten polupothete eutukhia. Me zelo ntetektib kai dieisdutikoteta psukhanalute o Zoulphi Libaneli odegei ton anagnoste sten aletheia tes Meriem, tes dekaeptakhrones oneiroparmenes kores pou meta to biasmo tes apo to theio tes kaleitai na thusiastei gia na xepluthei e ntrope, tou Tzemal, tou nearou xaderphou tes, tou stratiote pou epistrephei sto khorio os eroas kai kaleitai na einai ekeinos pou tha ektelesei ten poine sto onoma tes oikogeneias, kai tou Irphan, tou kathegete pou brisketai apo ten alle pleura tou pheggariou kai ginetai apo tukhe sunodoiporos ton duo paidion se mia megale peripeteia. Kai sto phonto tou bibliou, <>, opos to kharakterizei o Giasar Kemal, anaduetai kai despozei -antiphatike kai anise, goeteutike kai apotropaie- e semerine Tourkia. E Eutukhiaetan gia pollous menes to up' arithmon 1 mpest seler sten Tourkia."©
¦Basismeno se pragmatika biographika gegonota, to "Ntrount" exereuna ta aluta akoma musteria ton skoteinon teleutaion emeron tou Karolou Ntikens se mia bathia prototupe istoria pou epaletheuei to kharakterismo tou suggraphea Dan Simmons os "giganta tes suggraphes".
Ntrount
...einai to onoma kai o ephialtes pou katatrukhei ton Karolo Ntikens ta teleutaia pente khronia tes zoes tou.
Stis 9 Iouniou, 1865, o Ntikens kai e eromene tou epistrephoun krupha sto Londino, otan to treno tous pephtei se ena keno ste siderodromike gramme. Ola ta bagonia tes protes theses gkremizontai sten koilada apo kato, ektos apo ekeino tou Ntikens. Otan o Ntikens katebainei sten koilada gia na phrontisei tous nekrous kai tous etoimothanatous, e zoe tou allazei gia panta. Kai sten kardia autou tou ephialte pou tha kratesei pente khronia einai...
Ntrount...
to onoma pou o Ntikens psithurizei ston philo tou Gouilki Kolins. Enas exartemenos apo to labdano kai ligotero epitukhemenos suggrapheas, o Kolins periphronei tis euaisthesies tes biktorianes epokhes kai zei me te mia eromene tou kai kanei paidi me mia alle, alla isos einai o monadikos anthropos ste Ge me ton opoio o Ntikens mporei na moirastei to mustiko tou...
Ntrount. Me ten olo kai auxanomene emmone tou gia tis kruptes kai ta nekrotapheia, o Ntikens stamata na graphei gia tessera khronia kai peripheretai stis kheiroteres phtokhogeitonies kai katakombes tou Londinou te nukhta, eno pragmatopoiei demosies anagnoseis te mera, makabries anagnoseis pou tromokratoun to koino tou. Telika xekina na graphei auto pou tha ginotan to proto megalo aristourgematiko muthistorema musteriou, To Musterio tou Entouin Ntrount, an den diakoptotan gia panta apo ton..."¼	
¹	
Poia etan e gunaika pou polla khronia tora krubotan ste sophita tes <>, enos arkhontikou kapou sten Ekale; Kapoioi elegan pos etan e mikrotere kore tou allote epitukhemenou epikheirematia Mariou Nomikou, pou sta niata tes uperxe e kallone tes epokhes tes, kanontas tous antres na pephtoun sta podia tes kai na ekliparoun gia ena tes blemma.
Merikes phores oi diabates mporousan na diakrinoun ten akhne skia tes piso apo tis baries kourtines tou parathurou tes. Oi megaluteroi anapherontan se ena tragiko gegonos pou katestrepse te zoe tes mazi me ten ourania omorphia tes. Ki otan kleisteke pano ste sophita, den ten xanade mati anthropou pera apo ten adelphe tes Martha, pou statheke brakhos aklonetos dipla tes. Ki omos, kapote misousan e mia ten alle, delade e Aggela, giati e kalobole ma askhemoula Martha eikhe kanei polles prospatheies na erthoun pio konta. Mataia. Sten kardia tes Aggelas de khorouse agape gia kanenan. Mekhri pou xemerose e mera ekeine, e pio kharmosune tes zoes tes, gia na katalexei se tragodia...
Duo adelphes kai polla krummena mustika pou diaphulaxan gia khronia. Os te stigme pou anoixe to kouti tes Pandoras kai o anemos sarose ta panta aphenontas suntrimmia sto perasma tou."É	
Æ	"Erthes kai xaploses sta podia mou,
to teleutaio ekeino mesemeri,
esukha, adiamartureta, truphera.
Mou eipes khoris phone to teleutaio antio.
M' apokhaireteses me to soma sou.
Mono pou ego den to katalaba tote.
Koimethekes ligo ap' ten alle meria tes kardias sou.
Auto etan to teleutaio mas agkaliasma.
E teleutaia phora pou ta somata mas aggikhtekan.
Den eipes tipota.
M' apokhaireteses me ton tropo sou, eugenika, oraia.
To logiko sou den epiane to menuma gia na mou to ekphraseis.
Ma oute sou aresan oi melodramatismoi.
Ena bathu eukharisto mou eipe to kormi sou,
pou eikosi khronia alle den gnorise apo ten agkalia mou".
Italia. Rome. Dekaetia tou 1970. To skeniko mias erotikes istorias. Phainomenika asemanta stigmiotupa apo ten poreia mias skheses. Apo ten prote gnorimia kai ten trupheroteta os ten xaphnike apoleia tes agapemenes suntrophou. O threnos tou oristikou apokhorismou. E kathemerinoteta khoris ton allon. To aisthema tou kenou alla kai e graphe os lutrose. Sto bathos tou phontou o apoekhos mias taragmenes dekaetias...
Ena prototupo erotiko muthistorema. Kratiko Brabeio to 1980 (den egine dekto apo to suggraphea). Teleoptike seira to 1994. O <>Basiles Basilikos se mia apo tis kaluteres stigmes tou."Ü

Ù
E Zelikha Kazantzi apophasise prin apo eikosi khronia na pherei ste zoe ten exogame kore tes Asia kai na kratesei mustiko to onoma tou patera. E Asia megalonei sto idio spiti me te metera te giagia tes ten progiagia tes kai tis treis theies tes. Tesseris genies gunaikon ton Kazantzi zoun mazi se ena konaki tes Konstantinoupoles aphou oi antres tes oikogeneias pethainoun se neare elikia. Aute e katara alloste eikhe anagkasei ton Moustapha to monadiko aderpho tes Zelikha na egkataleipsei ten Tourkia kai na egkatastathei sten Amerike opou kai pantreuteke ten Amerikanida Roouz proen suzugo Armeniou tes diasporas melos polumelous oikogeneias prosphugon kai metera tes neares Armanous. Otan e Armanous apophasizei na anazetesei tis armenikes rizes tes taxideuei krupha sten Konstantinoupole kai philoxeneitai sto spiti ton Kazantzi. Ginetai phile me ten Asia tes milaei gia te genoktonia ton Armenion pou e tourkike istoria aposiopa eno e mantissa theia tes Asia e Mpanous taxideuei parea me to tzini tes sto khrono kai anakaluptei mustika kai tragodies pou exegoun polla...
Gia to biblio auto e Saphak kategoretheke gia <>dusphemese tes tourkikes ethnikes tautotetas basei tou arthrou 301 tou Tourkikou Poinikou Kodika. E polubrabeumene suggrapheas pou prothese tes etan na erthoun pio konta o tourkikos me ton armeniko lao apallakhteke telika apo ten kategoria.
